cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  To cite the code of Sophaxis, use this record.
  To cite a listed work, use the DOI of that work, not Sophaxis.
title: "Sophaxis: an overlay preprint server for philosophy and mathematics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nemoto
    given-names: Takuya
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-1406-0547"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cpsbvbng26-dotcom/sophaxis"
url: "https://sophaxis.vercel.app/"
abstract: >-
  An overlay preprint server for philosophy, mathematics, logic, the philosophy of
  mathematics and the philosophy of science. Authors submit a preprint deposited in a
  repository by its DOI and their ORCID iD; after moderation it is listed with a stable
  record page. Acceptance is moderation, not peer review. Built with Claude Code
  (Anthropic) at the author's request; Claude is not an author.
keywords:
  - preprint server
  - overlay journal
  - philosophy
  - mathematics
  - logic
  - open access
license: MIT
